        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> this seems like a feature that plugins have to actively call\n\n`:write` emits a progress event which indicates that the file is being written. If it \"flickers\" for a fast write, that's a decision of the host terminal (which should probably not show a progress UI for progress events that are near-instant).",
            "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:13:28Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/41713#issuecomment-6212170683",
